{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>18歲港將馬嘉言於IBF保齡球世界盃男子個人賽奪金，是本港第二位奪得世界盃男子個人金牌的球手。</p><p></p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BOWLING-1200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026k1FMkgXRMW1792389405.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p><br/></p><p>賽事在德國慕尼黑舉行，馬嘉言先以小組首名出線，再在準決賽擊敗荷蘭球手比華丹。決賽面對法國球手利奧斯，比分咬緊，先以一分優勢拿下首局，第二局再以203比198擊敗對手。是繼胡兆康後，時隔11年再有香港球手在世界盃賽事封王。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T06:38:46.345870+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T07:17:52.720017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T06:37:46.630738+00:00","content_hash":"11f78598b1145e4db942194f86b35d9f65c43d4173676b702e56acb98beebac8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}